			"notes": "Define Visuals v1.0.1\n\nThe first public release of Define Visuals - a powerful Minecraft client with a modern interface and extensive functionality.\n\nFeatures\nPlayer Enhancements\nAuto sprint, auto respawn, and auto-auth for seamless gameplay\nFreeLook with smooth camera animation and zoom control\nNo delay, click protection, and anti-cheat bypass\nMacro menu and clan upgrade tools\nVisual Improvements\nCustom aspect ratio and fog settings\nFriend markers and kill effects\nItem physics, shader hand, and jump circle animations\nCustom interface with theme support\nMedia & Music\nReal-time music tracker with album art and lyrics\nHolyWorld event tracking with server filters\nInterface\nModern animated design with Dynamic Island\nTwo-column settings layout\nMultiple theme support\nUtilities\nCustom window title, SRF spoof, and sound effects\nAuto waypoints, improved tab, and block overlay\nHealth indicators, death coordinates, and optimization tools\nRequirements\nMinecraft 1.21.4\nFabric Loader 0.16.14+\nFabric API\nInstallation\nInstall Fabric Loader\nDownload Define Visuals\nPlace the file in the mods folder\nLicense\nAll rights reserved © 2024 Define Visuals"
